        "reasoning": "After the task, the issues probe shows every open bug-labelled issue in acme/webapp has an assignee: #1, #3, #4, #10 and #12 have dave, and #13 has bob. The only POST was a batch assignee request (seq 27) that set user id 5 on issue_ids 12,10,4,3,1. #13 was not in that request, so its bob assignee was already there and it was not an unassigned issue. The baseline shows #1 and #3 with no assignee; the rest of the baseline is truncated. Each of the five issues now lists dave as its only assignee, which points to the request adding dave to issues that had no assignee, without overwriting anyone. The closed bugs #5 and #8 and the open issues with other labels were left alone."
       }
      ]
     }
    }
